(98, 34, 'Khisal Zafar', 'Khisal@digioussolutions.com', ' Lauren Rowe', 'lrowebooks@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, 'illustrations', '2 characters and a background\nThe illustration would be a white mail firefighter with dark blonde hair or he’s wearing his firefighter helmet and blue eyes who is very handsome and fit and a woman who is mixed Black and white with long black hair. He is a firefighter she is a physical therapist who wears scrubs. However, the scene could be from off-work, where they are in a clinch on a couch or in a kitchen or he could be in a swimming pool and she is standing on the ledge deciding whether to come in, or she is sitting on the ledge and he is looking up at her. The posing and background could be any of these things. He could also be propped up in bed shirtless and we see his upper bare torso with a blanket over his lap and she is working on his leg as a physical therapist. Really, if any of these things inspire you, any would work for me. I want the piece to look cinematic and not cartoonish, very romantic and almost like fantasy style, except that this is a contemporary romance, so nobody has elf ears, etc.', 500.00, 250.00, 'Ziffs PayPal', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-07', '2026-05-15', 'pending', NULL, 27, '2026-05-06 20:33:09', '2026-05-06 20:33:09'),
